{
 "_about": "Quest mode: the healer's journey down the Oshu Kaido from Aomori to Edo. Each stop is one game; win it to travel on, and pick a reward for your medicine chest (kept for the rest of the journey). Each stop adds one thing ('intro' names what's new, for the stop card). 'rules' are changes to rules.json for that game only (nested keys change just what they name; patients.tiers picks which tiers of the deck are in play; toolShop/claims false switch those off; quirks.force gives every patient one quirk; royal.you hands you that royal). 'rival' is how the bot plays: depth = the longest cure it looks for (5 = full strength), tools/curse false = it buys no tools / claims nobody, greedy = how readily it claims, headStart = mon it starts with, mods = boosts like a medicine chest's. Bosses are marked boss. 'at' is [longitude, latitude] on the map. Names and lines are in the language file under quest.stops.",
 "map": {
  "_about": "The journey map. 'svg' is the land drawing (its <path class=\"land\"> and <path class=\"border\"> shapes are used, in its own viewBox). 'project' turns [longitude, latitude] into that drawing's coordinates: x = a*lon + b*lat + c for each row, fitted to six capes from Soya to Nojimazaki (about 4 units out at most).",
